{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1000_p", "source_sha256": "47b8512cf8430a410d40729b7009d2bb70a08728ad056cf5c87ded9eea7ff15c", "ja": "（ドレスアップルームを覗くと、\nエレナがデストルドー役の衣装を着ていた……）", "zh": "（往换装室里一看，发现艾蕾娜穿着德斯特鲁多的服装……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "b722b27a7c39062ecca1ddbfd73097c40ab04a2e1be708cb4a39dce5d120fb3b", "ja": "うーん……あ、{$P$}。\n……ねぇ、今のワタシ……どう、見えるかな？", "zh": "嗯……啊，{$P$}。  \n……呐，你觉得现在的我……看起来怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0d9116ca977dfcaa031f06538b1ab959a94c360b05be1ba5a9507c21561d13e0", "ja": "うん？　しいて言うなら、かっこいいと思うけど。\n……急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？非要说的话，我觉得挺帅的。\n……怎么突然这么问？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "ccd2e6cf622d60e18a508c8102a450831b69f8c500471e998badf91aefd7146f", "ja": "あのネ……。この前、この衣装で出た\n予告イベントがあったデショ？", "zh": "那个呀……之前不是有个穿这套服装\n出场的预告活动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "4ac23f7b7b45412600a99ad2ce621ebc82fdf53dcfe7535500fa5e2d03a5d668", "ja": "あのお仕事の時、小さい子のひとりに\nすっごく怖がられたのを思い出して……。", "zh": "想起来了……那次工作的时候，有个小孩子特别害怕我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "6ed6dbb51d3bcfdd4af55bf99210d487568f28434405dd90c951b0152842c03c", "ja": "デストルドーのエレナは悪いコトをする子だから\n仕方ないけど……やっぱりちょっと寂しかったノ。", "zh": "不过，毁灭者的艾蕾娜是会做坏事的孩子，被害怕也是没办法的事……果然还是有点寂寞呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d3cdd6b67d8bf2103a7a1fbd34edd0a0287f2677a3de541cd473e53885c09f22", "ja": "なるほど。たしかに物語での役割上、どうしても\nそういう印象になってしまう所はあるよな。", "zh": "原来如此。确实，考虑到她在故事中的定位，难免会给人那样的印象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "d55679079fe159ecac234077171c202c163a963953d213f2cb1aece5b166de1e", "ja": "ウン……。でも、前向きに考えないとだよネ！\n怖いって思ってもらえたってコトは……。", "zh": "嗯……可是，还是要往积极的方面想才行呢！\n能让大家觉得害怕，也就说明……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "578eeafc071e608faa3ef0ee7efb27f18788806afc50d388ff6033faa37cd00a", "ja": "きっと、デストルドーの『エレナ』が、\nあの子の中でホンモノになってた、ってコトだもん。", "zh": "因为，这说明那孩子心中的“Destorudo的‘艾蕾娜’”，一定已经成为真正的存在了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1009_p", "source_sha256": "134fa35ea3b9a80d1bc84ad8763a7781ce6febd68b538807eddef0696b670f4d", "ja": "そうそう。それだけ良い演技ができたって事だよ。", "zh": "对对对。也就是说，她的演技真的好到这种程度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "7e8f90f7037d3d5199735396c0f94c7b451ed314a0f95a7dbd51dfcffed35652", "ja": "ウン……でもナー……。うう……。", "zh": "嗯……可是啊……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "575b4441d644fbf6150b84960bf43da6366a8232d79a2e3cf1f103ba20f3d6ff", "ja": "やっぱり、どうせならカッコいいって\n思われたかったヨー！", "zh": "果然，既然要做的话，\n人家还是希望能被夸帅气嘛——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b4bdecc0c8771deb9ec5789e579489690b32aa176b61051476606417508e4249", "ja": "はは、そっちが本音か。\nでも大丈夫、それならきっとできるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，原来那才是你的真心话啊。  \n不过没关系，既然如此，你一定能做到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "9a3fd982470a16616833c705c4c3a502cf4697804a25e90a8a7b756c0876bd8e", "ja": "エッ、ホント？\nどうすればいいノ？？", "zh": "诶，真的吗？\n该怎么办才好呀？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1014_p", "source_sha256": "778e739e98a5b5e43f34acdf782955a399eb767e190d423c9267983f1ab05716", "ja": "その姿のエレナが活躍する舞台は、ドラマの中だけじゃ\nない。もうひとつ、大事な場所があるだろ？", "zh": "那个模样的艾蕾娜大显身手的舞台，可不只在电视剧里，  \n还有另一个重要的地方，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "e19f0e1c1203d6b0339c5a59a2469c5d071ce1fec77caae05682720f048570dd", "ja": "この姿のワタシが、活躍する舞台……？\nあっ、わかったヨ～！", "zh": "这个模样的我大显身手的舞台……？\n啊，我知道了哟～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "ec2adf04f656c566f55f8423e0f219ac3b2ef455966ac98b95b59e2afa8e2352", "ja": "そうだネ、ライトに照らされて～、\nいっぱい歓声をもらえる、あの場所で！", "zh": "没错呢，在灯光照耀下～能收获好多欢呼声的那个地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0654_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "e80b455ae796641e2506491d3630760a7cdeea44827a6b96c71f394213a2ec19", "ja": "サイッコーにカッコいい『エレナ』を見せられる\nように……。ワタシ、がんばるネ♪", "zh": "为了能让大家看到最最帅气的『エレナ』……我会努力的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
